### 📦 **Module 2: Embedding Storage in Vector DB**

GCP does **not have a native vector database** yet (as of 2024), so you have two options:

| Option                                                     | Description                                                                            |
| ---------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Self-host FAISS** (via Compute Engine)                   | High-performance, open-source vector search. Use with Node.js/C#.                      |
| **Use Weaviate or Pinecone** (hosted on GCP or externally) | Scalable managed service; integrates via API. Both support metadata and hybrid search. |
| **BigQuery Vector Search (preview)**                       | If available in your region, it supports approximate nearest neighbor search.          |

