### 🛠 Recommended GCP Setup

| Component          | GCP Service                                            | Notes                                                    |
| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- |
| Object storage     | **Cloud Storage**                                      | Store raw and processed images.                          |
| Serverless compute | **Cloud Functions** or **Cloud Run**                   | Event-driven backend or API microservices.               |
| Facial API         | **Vision API** (limited) or **Vertex AI Custom Model** | Vision API is basic; for embeddings, use custom hosting. |
| Vector search      | **FAISS on Compute Engine** or **Pinecone/Weaviate**   | GCP-native vector search is limited.                     |
| Database           | **Cloud SQL for SQL Server**                           | Fully managed SQL Server instance.                       |

